// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - StrangeBiology 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2984193263" "Dr. Ido's concerns"
// DetailString :
"P3658462119" "When you rescued Dr. Victor Ido, he told you:<br><br>'We were trying to figure out how to reverse the process that turns people into Devouring Earth creatures. Well, we found something, but we're not yet sure what it means. We found biological agents in the blood of normal people that matched similar agents in the recently Devoured! We started taking blood samples from people all over the city, and we've been finding these biological contaminants in nearly every citizen we've tested. I'm not sure what the implications are, but I must admit I'm concerned.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - UnityManifesto 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1874986301" "Unity manifesto"
// DetailString :
"P1206612661" "This document speaks in rapturous terms of a great change that will come over every person in Paragon City. It refers to this coming change as 'The Unity,' and implores people not to fear their inevitable union with the Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - NoSample 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P179573443" "A fruitless search"
// DetailString :
"P3653558444" "You've searched this place completely. There's simply no sample of the Unity Plague here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PlagueSample 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1834332697" "Sample of the Unity Plague"
// DetailString :
"P1525059886" "You recovered this sample of the Unity Plague deep beneath the Earth. Like the Will of the Earth mutagen, this plague seems to be intelligent. You can sense its alien consciousness probing at your mind, ever hungry and waiting to be unleashed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - UnityCure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3020289349" "The Unity cure"
// DetailString :
"P3477137281" "These vials contain the cure to the Unity Plague. As with the plague itself, you can feel the collective consciousness of the organic compound you hold in your hand. But the cure is neither hungry nor malicious. It knows it has a job to do, and it's eager to get to it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode1Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2499949663" "The Unity Plague"
// DetailString :
"P3966760819" "It all began when you saved Dr. Victor Ido and his team of researchers from a Devouring Earth attack. You learned that the good doctor had been studying the process that transforms humans into Devouring Earth creatures, and he had made some alarming discoveries. He had isolated a biological contaminant that was present in both normal humans and the recently Devoured."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode2Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P4040636344" "It all began when you saved Dr. Victor Ido and his team of researchers from a Devouring Earth attack. You learned that the good doctor had been studying the process that transforms humans into Devouring Earth creatures, and he had made some alarming discoveries. He had isolated a biological contaminant that was present in both normal humans and the recently Devoured. <br><br>You were contacted by Dr. Ido's research team again, this time for help capturing some Devoured creatures so they could confirm a hypothesis. While hunting the creatures, you discovered a new Devouring Earth manifesto that talked about a coming 'Unity.' It urged humankind not to fear the coming change. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode3Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P427644549" "It all began when you saved Dr. Victor Ido and his team of researchers from a Devouring Earth attack. You learned that the good doctor had been studying the process that transforms humans into Devouring Earth creatures, and he had made some alarming discoveries. He had isolated a biological contaminant that was present in both normal humans and the recently Devoured. <br><br>You were contacted by Dr. Ido's research team again, this time for help capturing some Devoured creatures so they could confirm a hypothesis. While hunting the creatures, you discovered a new Devouring Earth manifesto that talked about a coming 'Unity.' It urged humankind not to fear the coming change. <br><br>With the information you gathered, Dr. Ido's team was able to confirm their hypothesis. The biological contaminant was the first part of the Devouring Earth's new mutagenic plague. Ninety percent of the city was already infected. You began a desperate search for a sample of the plague."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode4Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3723691422" "It all began when you saved Dr. Victor Ido and his team of researchers from a Devouring Earth attack. You learned that the good doctor had been studying the process that transforms humans into Devouring Earth creatures, and he had made some alarming discoveries. He had isolated a biological contaminant that was present in both normal humans and the recently Devoured. <br><br>You were contacted by Dr. Ido's research team again, this time for help capturing some Devoured creatures so they could confirm a hypothesis. While hunting the creatures, you discovered a new Devouring Earth manifesto that talked about a coming 'Unity.' It urged humankind not to fear the coming change. <br><br>With the information you gathered, Dr. Ido's team was able to confirm their hypothesis. The biological contaminant was the first part of the Devouring Earth's new mutagenic plague. Ninety percent of the city was already infected. You began a desperate search for a sample of the plague. When you found a sample, Dr. Ido used it to engineer a cure."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode5Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P401094070" "It all began when you saved Dr. Victor Ido and his team of researchers from a Devouring Earth attack. You learned that the good doctor had been studying the process that transforms humans into Devouring Earth creatures, and he had made some alarming discoveries. He had isolated a biological contaminant that was present in both normal humans and the recently Devoured. <br><br>You were contacted by Dr. Ido's research team again, this time for help capturing some Devoured creatures so they could confirm a hypothesis. While hunting the creatures, you discovered a new Devouring Earth manifesto that talked about a coming 'Unity.' It urged humankind not to fear the coming change. <br><br>With the information you gathered, Dr. Ido's team was able to confirm their hypothesis. The biological contaminant was the first part of the Devouring Earth's new mutagenic plague. Ninety percent of the city was already infected. You began a desperate search for a sample of the plague. When you found a sample, Dr. Ido used it to engineer a cure. <br><br>The Devouring Earth attacked Dr. Ido's new lab, but you arrived just in time to fend them off."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - Episode6Clue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P4168541959" "It all began when you saved Dr. Victor Ido and his team of researchers from a Devouring Earth attack. You learned that the good doctor had been studying the process that transforms humans into Devouring Earth creatures, and he had made some alarming discoveries. He had isolated a biological contaminant that was present in both normal humans and the recently Devoured. <br><br>You were contacted by Dr. Ido's research team again, this time for help capturing some Devoured creatures so they could confirm a hypothesis. While hunting the creatures, you discovered a new Devouring Earth manifesto that talked about a coming 'Unity.' It urged humankind not to fear the coming change. <br><br>With the information you gathered, Dr. Ido's team was able to confirm their hypothesis. The biological contaminant was the first part of the Devouring Earth's new mutagenic plague. Ninety percent of the city was already infected. You began a desperate search for a sample of the plague. When you found a sample, Dr. Ido used it to engineer a cure. <br><br>The Devouring Earth attacked Dr. Ido's new lab, but you arrived just in time to fend them off. <br><br>With the cure synthesized, all that remained was to distribute it throughout the city. You took the cure to each of the signature heroes of Paragon City. When you reached Numina, she had a dire warning for you. The Devouring Earth had already created a counter-agent and were about to nullify the cure!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL6_DevouringEarth_SouveneirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P696439405" "Sample of the Unity cure"
// tDetailString :
"P1860450358" "You've kept this small, intelligent sample of the Unity cure as a potent reminder of the time you stopped:<br><br>The Unity Plague<br><br>It all began when you saved Dr. Victor Ido and his team of researchers from a Devouring Earth attack. You learned that the good doctor had been studying the process that transforms humans into Devouring Earth creatures, and he had made some alarming discoveries. He had isolated a biological contaminant that was present in both normal humans and the recently Devoured. <br><br>You were contacted by Dr. Ido's research team again, this time for help capturing some Devoured creatures so they could confirm a hypothesis. While hunting the creatures, you discovered a new Devouring Earth manifesto that talked about a coming 'Unity.' It urged humankind not to fear the coming change. <br><br>With the information you gathered, Dr. Ido's team was able to confirm their hypothesis. The biological contaminant was the first part of the Devouring Earth's new mutagenic plague. Ninety percent of the city was already infected. You began a desperate search for a sample of the plague. When you found a sample, Dr. Ido used it to engineer a cure. <br><br>The Devouring Earth attacked Dr. Ido's new lab, but you arrived just in time to fend them off. <br><br>With the cure synthesized, all that remained was to distribute it throughout the city. You took the cure to each of the signature heroes of Paragon City. When you reached Numina, she had a dire warning for you. The Devouring Earth had already created a counter-agent and were about to nullify the cure! <br><br>With Numina's warning fresh in your mind, you fought the Devouring Earth and destroyed the counter-agent, forever ending the threat of the Unity Plague."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_DE_Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1325676969" "A group of scientists are under attack by the Devouring Earth. They're doing critical work towards understanding and maybe even reversing the process that the creatures uses to convert people into their own kind. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to rescue those scientists from the Devouring Earth, {HeroName}.</A> If we are ever to defeat the Devouring Earth forever, we cannot afford to lose these researchers."
// AcceptString :
"P1100610618" "Rescue the scientists from the Devouring Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P1603858229" "I want every Devouring Earth creature accounted for, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1777482283" "Defeat all creatures in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P55773539" "Those researchers' lives are in your hands!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3346103134" "The door looks as if it's been kicked in by a 20-pound foot."
