"P79172519" "Researcher"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2568205353" "Thank you for saving me!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4143971780" "You have defeated the Devouring Earth and saved all the scientists."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4227840799" "Dr. Ido and his lab crew send you their thanks, {HeroName}. They're relocating to a new lab so they can continue their research into the process that turns people into Devouring Earth creatures. These biological contaminants they found in normal human blood are very worrying. Especially since the same contaminants exist in the recently Devoured. I've asked Dr. Ido to keep me appraised of their work."
// RandomFameString :
"P2673878709" "I heard that {HeroName} is onto something big involving the Devouring Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_DE_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3896182027" "I just spoke with Dr. Victor Ido, that researcher you rescued from the Devouring Earth. He said that his lab is nearing a major breakthrough in determining the source of those strange biological contaminants they found both in normal human blood and in the recently Devoured. The problem is, they need some recently Devoured creatures in order to confirm their conclusions. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you capture some Devouring Earth creature for the scientists to study?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P204075777" "Capture a Devouring Earth creature for the scientists"
// SendOffString :
"P3252101237" "Well, it's all for science. They've located some appropriate creatures, and I've isolated them with an emergency force field. Just take the Light Rail over to the Ulysses Keys."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2355269509" "Capture several test subjects"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P261711321" "The scientists are still waiting on those test subjects."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P1081127137" "The Ulyssees Keys"
// EntryString :
"P757434244" "The Devouring Earth have claimed this area near Talos Island as their own."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3053278644" "Test Subject"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P312489419" "Grrrruaaahhh."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
