// Dialog :
"P1386724667" "You found a Devouring Earth manifesto."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2646917575" "You have captured the test subjects and found a Devouring Earth manifesto."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2889310656" "The creatures you captured have already been picked up by the lab's research team. They won't hurt them; after all, those critters used to be Paragon citizens! This manifesto you found really worries me, {HeroName}. I don't know what to make of it, but I have a bad feeling it's going to tie into all of this somehow. Check back with me later, I'll keep you informed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_DE_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3208324563" "I just spoke with Dr. Ido. He was able to confirm his theories after you brought him those Devoured creatures. And his conclusions are alarming. It seems the whole time we've been fighting the Devouring Earth, those creatures have had another plan in the works. It's an intelligent virus called the Unity Plague. They've been introducing it to our water for months, and they're getting ready to release the catalyst that will set it off. Dr. Ido and his team need a sample of the plague right away if they're going to combat it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you go find a sample of the Unity Plague?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3657714731" "Find a sample of the Unity Plague"
// SendOffString :
"P2350539036" "From the looks of things, those creatures have been releasing the plague into our water on a regular schedule. There's a good chance you can find some if you head to the sewers."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P113908099" "Stop lead creature, its minions"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P906403951" "We need a sample of the Unity Plague, and we need it fast!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P856936218" "The guttural grunts and cries of the Devouring Earth echo over the sound of running waters."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P79805850" "Lesser Devoured"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2530338368" "DEVOUR YOU!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2175470144" "You have searched, but found no sample of the Unity Plague here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4044099853" "So you couldn't find a sample of the Unity Plague, eh? We may have moved too early. We'll just have to keep trying, {HeroName}. If we don't get a sample of that plague soon, the Devouring Earth may succeed in turning all of us into monsters!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_DE_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P20637792" "According to Dr. Ido, the Devouring Earth should be almost ready to release a catalyst that will set off this Unity Plague they've been infecting people with. There's no time to lose. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can recover a plague sample, Dr. Ido may be able to engineer a cure before it's too late.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2982463169" "Recover a plague sample"
// SendOffString :
"P2666690079" "Excellent. We think that the Devouring Earth are keeping a supply of the Unity Plague in a series of caverns, deep beneath the earth. I've marked the entrance for you."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1800834308" "Recover Unity Plague sample"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P217742192" "Your only goal is to recover that sample of the plague. I know you can do it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1920864141" "The interior of this cavern is filled with moist, warm air. It's a perfect environment for healthy viral growth."
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG1 :
"P3112890085" "Unity is forever!"
// Script Variable PATROLLER_ATTACK_DIALOG2 :
"P393537953" "You can't stop us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - UnityPlague 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3524833866" "Crate"
// InteractBeginString :
"P385403844" "You check the crate."
