"P1859270758" "You have confirmed the crate's contents."
// InteractActionString :
"P92689303" "Checking..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P247510814" "You found a sample of the Unity Plague."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3428991750" "The city owes you for recovering this sample of the Unity Plague, {HeroName}. I'll make sure that Dr. Ido and his team get it immediately. With any luck, they'll be able to whip up a cure in a hurry."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_DE_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2399627061" "There's big trouble, {HeroName}. Dr. Ido and his team are under attack. It seems the Devouring Earth found out that he was working on a cure for their Unity Plague. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to save those scientists.</A> The future of Paragon City may well rest in their hands."
// AcceptString :
"P2317029945" "Save the scientists"
// SendOffString :
"P2008234713" "Thanks, {HeroName}. Be careful out there."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1277079780" "You better get over to that lab. They can't hold out against the Devouring Earth forever!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2329826465" "The floor is littered with shattered glass beakers."
