"P1415736741" "You have defeated the Devouring Earth and saved Dr. Ido's team."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2841073332" "Dr. Ido sends his thanks, as well as word that they are getting close to a cure for the Unity Plague."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_DE_Compound6.3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3246888561" "Dr. Ido and his team have finished the cure; now they just need to distribute it to the city. Unfortunately, there's a complication, and that's where they need some help. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Are you willing to distribute the cure to the Unity Plague?</A> It won't be easy. In order to make a cure that could counter the Unity Plague and prevent a future infection, Dr. Ido had to reengineer the plague itself. So the cure is, well, semi-intelligent. And the Devouring Earth can detect it. So there's a very good chance they'll be trying to stop you."
// AcceptString :
"P1789166895" "Distribute the cure for the Unity Plague"
// SendOffString :
"P873786125" "Each of the city's signature heroes is waiting for you to deliver a portion of the cure. They'll use their network of heroes to get the cure out quickly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_DE_Compound6.3_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1471802636" "Take Unity cure to Ms. Liberty"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1124804216" "First get the cure to Ms. Liberty in Atlas Park."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3973468091" "Unity is inevitable!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2942802506" "You're at the top of your game, {HeroName}. I'll make sure this gets distributed properly. Blue Steel's next on the list. I'll see you around."

