// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1129135826" "I have been watching your progress from the astral realm, {HeroName}, and you have done very well. Now, however, I must deliver unto you a dire warning. The despicable Devouring Earth have already begun work on a counter-agent to the cure you have delivered. Go now and speak with the one who sent you. You have spared the city for now, but soon you will be needed once more."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1603327282" "Here's the cure to the Unity Plague. Thank you, {HeroName}, and good luck!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1418190191" "You did it! Normally I'd say you should take some time out and celebrate, but Numina's warning changes everything. If the Devouring Earth really are working on a counter-agent to the cure you delivered, we may have to move fast!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1888160384" "If it weren't for {HeroName}, everyone in this city would be a hideous creature by now!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_DE_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2177405800" "I spoke with Dr. Ido about Numina's warning. He agrees that if the Devouring Earth could develop a counter-agent quickly, they might be able to prevent the cure you distributed from taking effect. The Unity Plague may still be upon us! In order to distribute the counter-agent quickly enough, the Devouring Earth would have to introduce it to the water supply near the purification system. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you go to the sewers and destroy the Devouring Earth's counter-agent?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2992182546" "Destroy the Devouring Earth's counter-agent"
// SendOffString :
"P1513965998" "You are a true champion of this city, {HeroName}. I know you won't let us down."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2832443012" "Destroy the counter-agent"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3047157539" "If you don't destroy that counter-agent quickly, the Unity Plague could turn all of our citizens into monsters!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P22566715" "The howls and cries of the Devouring Earth fill the air. It looks like you're in the right place."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2027207029" "Unity comes!"
// Script Variable OBJECT_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3438370404" "Counter-agent"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3051122531" "You will not stop the Unity!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - UnityPlague 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P2711344763" "barrels to destroy"
// SingularDescription :
"P1418715311" "Destroy the last barrel!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1269418732" "All will be one!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2170097055" "Join the Hamidon!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1729551629" "You have destroyed the counter-agent and stopped the threat of the Unity Plague."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P239912111" "The threat of the Unity Plague is over! You did it, {HeroName}! The whole city owes you. With the cure in place, we should be able to reduce the threat of any similar viruses in the future. The city government is also working with FEMA to stockpile stores of the cure in case the Devouring Earth try this trick in another city. Dr. Ido tells me that the information you helped him gather has taught him a lot about the process that turns humans into Devouring Earth monsters. Someday, he hopes, they'll even be able to reverse it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
